# CLAUDE.local.md — local-only notes (do not commit)

Copy to `CLAUDE.local.md` for machine-specific notes:

- **Canonical repo path:** `Z:\independentz\Web\minimalcnx` (portable). Any shortcut under `Downloads\` must be a junction to that path — not a second clone.
- VPS SSH host / user (for deploy from laptop; otherwise run `deploy.sh` on the VPS)
- Whether each SQL migration has been applied on the live Supabase project (checklist in `CLAUDE.md`)
- Personal smoke-test accounts (never real passwords)
